{"ok": true, "summary": "Built an aluminium cold plate with six serial straight passes, five semicircular returns, and same-side inlet/outlet ports. The specified plate, channel, cover-wall and port dimensions are retained; unspecified pass spacing and end margins are assumed, with the wall interpreted as the top cover thickness. Uniform cell heating is distributed over the internal wetted area for the prescribed thermal approximation. This lumped/one-dimensional estimate uses bulk energy balance, hydraulic-diameter correlations and local-loss coefficients, with typical screening uncertainty of ±15–25%; transition-flow and bend effects can increase that uncertainty. Unlike CFD, it does not resolve velocity fields, recirculation, conjugate heat spreading or cell contact resistance. Use it to compare flow rates, coolants and channel layouts; final temperatures and pressure losses require CFD or testing.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Cold-plate screening estimate</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263344}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nbutton,select,input{font:inherit;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;background:white;padding:4px}\nbutton{padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\ninput{width:46px}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px}\n.scale{height:10px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1d4ed8,#06b6d4,#22c55e,#facc15,#dc2626)}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:16px;background:white;color:#b00020;text-align:center}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Cold-plate thermal screening</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">320 × 180 × 12 mm · Al · 2 kW top load</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 serial passes · 10 × 6 mm · cover 1.5 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pitch 26 mm · return R13 · ports Ø12 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><select id=\"fluid\" aria-label=\"Coolant\"><option value=\"glycol\">50% ethylene glycol</option><option value=\"water\">Pure water</option></select> <input id=\"flow\" aria-label=\"Flow in litres per minute\" type=\"number\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"40\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"8\"> L/min</div>\n<div id=\"temps\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div id=\"hydro\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div id=\"htc\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">Colour: local temperature; grey: aluminium; blue: fluid in material view.</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"scale\"></div><div class=\"ends\"><span id=\"low\"></span><span id=\"high\"></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\">1-D correlations, not CFD; nominal ±15–25%.<br>Transition, contacts and heat spreading unresolved.</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">Material view</button><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Geometry in mm; six passes, with semicircular series connections.\n  length:320,width:180,thickness:12,passes:6,channelWidth:10,\n  channelDepth:6,wall:1.5,pitch:26,endMargin:25,\n  portDiameter:12,portOuterDiameter:16,portLength:18,\n  straightSegments:24,bendSegments:24,\n  // SI properties at 25 °C; nominal aluminium conductivity and density.\n  heat:2000,inlet:25,flowLpm:8,fluid:'glycol',alK:200,alDensity:2700,\n  fluids:{\n    glycol:{rho:1069,cp:3280,mu:3.4e-3,k:0.38,Pr:29},\n    water:{rho:997,cp:4180,mu:0.89e-3,k:0.607,Pr:6.1}\n  },\n  bendK:1.5,portK:1.5,laminarNu:4,transitionRe:2300,\n  fadeDistance:20,metalness:.85,roughness:.35,\n  aluminum:'#d4d9e0',fluidColor:'#3b82f6',\n  temperatureColors:['#1d4ed8','#06b6d4','#22c55e','#facc15','#dc2626']\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const node=document.getElementById('error');\n  node.style.display='block';node.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',event=>showError(event.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(160,350,200);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.aluminum,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const fluidMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xffffff,metalness:0,roughness:.6,transparent:true,opacity:.55,depthWrite:false});\n  const tempMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,metalness:0,roughness:.6,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const span=P.length-2*P.endMargin, radius=P.pitch/2;\n  const startX=-span/2,endX=span/2,startZ=-(P.passes-1)*P.pitch/2;\n  const channelTop=P.thickness/2-P.wall,channelBottom=channelTop-P.channelDepth;\n  const channelY=(channelTop+channelBottom)/2;\n  // Route includes both in-plate port leads; external fittings use a lumped K.\n  const pieces=[],points=[],samples=[];\n  let routeLength=0;\n  function addLine(a,b,n){\n    for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n      const t0=i/n,t1=(i+1)/n;\n      const u=new THREE.Vector2().lerpVectors(a,b,t0);\n      const v=new THREE.Vector2().lerpVectors(a,b,t1);\n      const len=u.distanceTo(v);\n      pieces.push({u,v,len,s:routeLength+len/2});\n      routeLength+=len;\n      if(!points.length)points.push(u);\n      points.push(v);\n    }\n  }\n  function addBend(cx,cz,direction){\n    for(let i=0;i<P.bendSegments;i++){\n      const a=-Math.PI/2+i*Math.PI/P.bendSegments;\n      const b=-Math.PI/2+(i+1)*Math.PI/P.bendSegments;\n      const u=new THREE.Vector2(cx+direction*radius*Math.cos(a),cz+radius*Math.sin(a));\n      const v=new THREE.Vector2(cx+direction*radius*Math.cos(b),cz+radius*Math.sin(b));\n      const len=Math.PI*radius/P.bendSegments;\n      pieces.push({u,v,len,s:routeLength+len/2});routeLength+=len;points.push(v);\n    }\n  }\n  addLine(new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,startZ),new THREE.Vector2(startX,startZ),12);\n  for(let i=0;i<P.passes;i++){\n    const z=startZ+i*P.pitch,forward=i%2===0;\n    addLine(new THREE.Vector2(forward?startX:endX,z),new THREE.Vector2(forward?endX:startX,z),P.straightSegments);\n    if(i<P.passes-1)addBend(forward?endX:startX,z+radius,forward?1:-1);\n  }\n  addLine(new THREE.Vector2(startX,-startZ),new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,-startZ),12);\n  function box(w,h,d,x,y,z,material=metal){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),material);\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);modelGroup.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  box(P.length,channelBottom+P.thickness/2,P.width,0,(-P.thickness/2+channelBottom)/2,0);\n  // Subtract a polygonal ribbon from the middle layer using a Shape hole.\n  const outer=new THREE.Shape();\n  outer.moveTo(-P.length/2-.02,-P.width/2);outer.lineTo(P.length/2,-P.width/2);\n  outer.lineTo(P.length/2,P.width/2);outer.lineTo(-P.length/2-.02,P.width/2);outer.closePath();\n  const left=[],right=[];\n  points.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    const prev=points[Math.max(0,i-1)],next=points[Math.min(points.length-1,i+1)];\n    const tangent=next.clone().sub(prev).normalize();\n    const normal=new THREE.Vector2(-tangent.y,tangent.x).multiplyScalar(P.channelWidth/2);\n    left.push(p.clone().add(normal));right.push(p.clone().sub(normal));\n  });\n  const ribbon=left.concat(right.reverse()),hole=new THREE.Path();\n  ribbon.forEach((p,i)=>i?hole.lineTo(p.x,-p.y):hole.moveTo(p.x,-p.y));\n  hole.closePath();outer.holes.push(hole);\n  const coreGeo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(outer,{depth:P.channelDepth,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:12});\n  coreGeo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);coreGeo.translate(0,channelBottom,0);\n  modelGroup.add(new THREE.Mesh(coreGeo,metal));\n  const cover=box(P.length,P.wall,P.width,0,P.thickness/2-P.wall/2,0);\n  const ports=[];\n  for(const z of [startZ,-startZ]){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,P.portOuterDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const bore=new THREE.Path();bore.absarc(0,0,P.portDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(bore);\n    const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:P.portLength,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n    geo.rotateY(-Math.PI/2);\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(geo,metal);port.position.set(-P.length/2,channelY,z);\n    modelGroup.add(port);ports.push(port);\n    const boreMesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.portDiameter/2,P.portDiameter/2,P.portLength,24),fluidMaterial.clone());\n    boreMesh.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;boreMesh.position.set(-P.length/2-P.portLength/2,channelY,z);\n    modelGroup.add(boreMesh);\n  }\n  const flowMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,P.channelDepth,P.channelWidth),fluidMaterial,pieces.length);\n  const dummy=new THREE.Object3D();\n  pieces.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    dummy.position.set((p.u.x+p.v.x)/2,channelY,(p.u.y+p.v.y)/2);\n    dummy.rotation.set(0,-Math.atan2(p.v.y-p.u.y,p.v.x-p.u.x),0);\n    dummy.scale.set(p.u.distanceTo(p.v)+.08,1,1);dummy.updateMatrix();\n    flowMesh.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);\n    samples.push({x:dummy.position.x,z:dummy.position.z,s:p.s});\n  });\n  flowMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;flowMesh.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(flowMesh);\n  const surfaceGeo=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(P.length,P.width,64,36);\n  surfaceGeo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);surfaceGeo.translate(0,P.thickness/2+.04,0);\n  const positions=surfaceGeo.attributes.position;\n  surfaceGeo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(new Float32Array(positions.count*3),3));\n  const surface=new THREE.Mesh(surfaceGeo,tempMaterial);modelGroup.add(surface);\n  const nearest=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<positions.count;i++){\n    let best=Infinity,localS=0;\n    const x=positions.getX(i),z=positions.getZ(i);\n    pieces.forEach(p=>{\n      const dx=p.v.x-p.u.x,dz=p.v.y-p.u.y;\n      const t=THREE.MathUtils.clamp(((x-p.u.x)*dx+(z-p.u.y)*dz)/(dx*dx+dz*dz),0,1);\n      const distance=Math.hypot(x-p.u.x-t*dx,z-p.u.y-t*dz);\n      if(distance<best){best=distance;localS=p.s+(t-.5)*p.len;}\n    });\n    nearest.push({s:localS,d:Math.max(0,best-P.channelWidth/2)});\n  }\n  function calculate(){\n    const c=P.fluids[P.fluid],Q=P.flowLpm/60000,A=P.channelWidth*P.channelDepth*1e-6;\n    const wet=2*(P.channelWidth+P.channelDepth)*.001,Dh=4*A/wet,L=routeLength*.001;\n    const v=Q/A,Re=c.rho*v*Dh/c.mu,Nu=Re<P.transitionRe?P.laminarNu:.023*Re**.8*c.Pr**.4;\n    const h=Nu*c.k/Dh,rise=P.heat/(c.rho*Q*c.cp),flux=P.heat/(wet*L);\n    const offset=flux/h+flux*P.wall*.001/P.alK;\n    const f=Re<P.transitionRe?64/Re:.316*Re**(-.25);\n    const vf=Q/(Math.PI*(P.portDiameter*.001)**2/4);\n    const friction=f*L/Dh*c.rho*v*v/2;\n    const bends=(P.passes-1)*P.bendK*c.rho*v*v/2,connections=P.portK*c.rho*vf*vf/2;\n    const outlet=P.inlet+rise,maxWall=outlet+offset,dp=(friction+bends+connections)/1000;\n    const labels=['Outlet temperature','Max wall temperature','Total pressure drop','Reynolds number','Convective HTC','Total flow-path length'];\n    const units=['°C','°C','kPa','','W/(m²·K)','m'];\n    const values=[outlet.toFixed(2),maxWall.toFixed(2),dp.toFixed(2),Re.toFixed(0),h.toFixed(0),L.toFixed(3)];\n    const metrics=labels.map((label,i)=>({label,value:values[i],unit:units[i],note:'Page live calculation takes precedence'}));\n    return {rise,offset,maxWall,metrics,friction,bends,connections};\n  }\n  const palette=P.temperatureColors.map(c=>new THREE.Color(c));\n  let result,temperatureMode=true,sectionMode=false;\n  function tempColor(T){\n    const t=THREE.MathUtils.clamp((T-P.inlet)/(result.maxWall-P.inlet),0,1)*4;\n    const i=Math.min(3,Math.floor(t));return palette[i].clone().lerp(palette[i+1],t-i);\n  }\n  function refresh(){\n    result=calculate();window.__metrics=result.metrics;\n    const m=result.metrics;\n    document.getElementById('temps').textContent=`Outlet ${m[0].value} °C · peak wall ${m[1].value} °C`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').textContent=`Δp ${m[2].value} kPa · Re ${m[3].value}`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').title=`Friction ${(result.friction/1000).toFixed(2)}, bends ${(result.bends/1000).toFixed(2)}, ports ${(result.connections/1000).toFixed(2)} kPa`;\n    document.getElementById('htc').textContent=`h ${m[4].value} W/(m²·K) · flow path ${m[5].value} m`;\n    document.getElementById('low').textContent=P.inlet.toFixed(1)+' °C';\n    document.getElementById('high').textContent=result.maxWall.toFixed(1)+' °C';\n    pieces.forEach((p,i)=>flowMesh.setColorAt(i,temperatureMode?tempColor(P.inlet+result.rise*p.s/routeLength):new THREE.Color(P.fluidColor)));\n    flowMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;\n    const colors=surfaceGeo.attributes.color;\n    nearest.forEach((p,i)=>{\n      const wall=P.inlet+(result.rise*p.s/routeLength+result.offset)*Math.exp(-p.d/P.fadeDistance);\n      const color=tempColor(wall);colors.setXYZ(i,color.r,color.g,color.b);\n    });\n    colors.needsUpdate=true;surface.visible=temperatureMode&&!sectionMode;cover.visible=!sectionMode;\n  }\n  document.getElementById('fluid').onchange=e=>{P.fluid=e.target.value;refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('flow').oninput=e=>{const value=Number(e.target.value);if(value>0&&value<=40){P.flowLpm=value;refresh();}};\n  document.getElementById('mode').onclick=e=>{temperatureMode=!temperatureMode;e.target.textContent=temperatureMode?'Material view':'Temperature map';refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=e=>{sectionMode=!sectionMode;e.target.textContent=sectionMode?'Full view':'Section view';refresh();};\n  const rotateButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  rotateButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');};\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: off';});\n  refresh();\n  const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  function fit(){\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    const angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);\n  }\n  fit();\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(500,20,0xdad6cf,0xe9e5df);\n  grid.position.y=bounds.min.y-2;scene.add(grid);\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();});\n  Object.assign(window,{__scene:scene,__camera:camera,__renderer:renderer,__controls:controls,__model:modelGroup});\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error) {showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Outlet temperature", "value": "29.28", "unit": "°C", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}, {"label": "Max wall temperature", "value": "51.00", "unit": "°C", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}, {"label": "Total pressure drop", "value": "47.15", "unit": "kPa", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}, {"label": "Reynolds number", "value": "5240", "unit": "", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}, {"label": "Convective HTC", "value": "1539", "unit": "W/(m²·K)", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}, {"label": "Total flow-path length", "value": "1.874", "unit": "m", "note": "Page live calculation takes precedence"}], "suggestions": ["Compare glycol and pure water across flow rates from 4 to 12 L/min.", "Compare this series layout with six parallel channels, including manifold losses.", "Add cell contact resistance and a conjugate heat-spreading estimate."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nBuilt an aluminium cold plate with six serial straight passes, five semicircular returns, and same-side inlet/outlet ports. The specified plate, channel, cover-wall and port dimensions are retained; unspecified pass spacing and end margins are assumed, with the wall interpreted as the top cover thickness. Uniform cell heating is distributed over the internal wetted area for the prescribed thermal approximation. This lumped/one-dimensional estimate uses bulk energy balance, hydraulic-diameter correlations and local-loss coefficients, with typical screening uncertainty of ±15–25%; transition-flow and bend effects can increase that uncertainty. Unlike CFD, it does not resolve velocity fields, recirculation, conjugate heat spreading or cell contact resistance. Use it to compare flow rates, coolants and channel layouts; final temperatures and pressure losses require CFD or testing.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Cold-plate screening estimate</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263344}\n#panel h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nbutton,select,input{font:inherit;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;background:white;padding:4px}\nbutton{padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\ninput{width:46px}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px}\n.scale{height:10px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1d4ed8,#06b6d4,#22c55e,#facc15,#dc2626)}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:16px;background:white;color:#b00020;text-align:center}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Cold-plate thermal screening</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">320 × 180 × 12 mm · Al · 2 kW top load</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 serial passes · 10 × 6 mm · cover 1.5 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pitch 26 mm · return R13 · ports Ø12 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><select id=\"fluid\" aria-label=\"Coolant\"><option value=\"glycol\">50% ethylene glycol</option><option value=\"water\">Pure water</option></select> <input id=\"flow\" aria-label=\"Flow in litres per minute\" type=\"number\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"40\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"8\"> L/min</div>\n<div id=\"temps\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div id=\"hydro\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div id=\"htc\" class=\"row\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">Colour: local temperature; grey: aluminium; blue: fluid in material view.</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"scale\"></div><div class=\"ends\"><span id=\"low\"></span><span id=\"high\"></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\">1-D correlations, not CFD; nominal ±15–25%.<br>Transition, contacts and heat spreading unresolved.</div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">Material view</button><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Geometry in mm; six passes, with semicircular series connections.\n  length:320,width:180,thickness:12,passes:6,channelWidth:10,\n  channelDepth:6,wall:1.5,pitch:26,endMargin:25,\n  portDiameter:12,portOuterDiameter:16,portLength:18,\n  straightSegments:24,bendSegments:24,\n  // SI properties at 25 °C; nominal aluminium conductivity and density.\n  heat:2000,inlet:25,flowLpm:8,fluid:'glycol',alK:200,alDensity:2700,\n  fluids:{\n    glycol:{rho:1069,cp:3280,mu:3.4e-3,k:0.38,Pr:29},\n    water:{rho:997,cp:4180,mu:0.89e-3,k:0.607,Pr:6.1}\n  },\n  bendK:1.5,portK:1.5,laminarNu:4,transitionRe:2300,\n  fadeDistance:20,metalness:.85,roughness:.35,\n  aluminum:'#d4d9e0',fluidColor:'#3b82f6',\n  temperatureColors:['#1d4ed8','#06b6d4','#22c55e','#facc15','#dc2626']\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const node=document.getElementById('error');\n  node.style.display='block';node.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',event=>showError(event.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(160,350,200);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.aluminum,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const fluidMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xffffff,metalness:0,roughness:.6,transparent:true,opacity:.55,depthWrite:false});\n  const tempMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,metalness:0,roughness:.6,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const span=P.length-2*P.endMargin, radius=P.pitch/2;\n  const startX=-span/2,endX=span/2,startZ=-(P.passes-1)*P.pitch/2;\n  const channelTop=P.thickness/2-P.wall,channelBottom=channelTop-P.channelDepth;\n  const channelY=(channelTop+channelBottom)/2;\n  // Route includes both in-plate port leads; external fittings use a lumped K.\n  const pieces=[],points=[],samples=[];\n  let routeLength=0;\n  function addLine(a,b,n){\n    for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n      const t0=i/n,t1=(i+1)/n;\n      const u=new THREE.Vector2().lerpVectors(a,b,t0);\n      const v=new THREE.Vector2().lerpVectors(a,b,t1);\n      const len=u.distanceTo(v);\n      pieces.push({u,v,len,s:routeLength+len/2});\n      routeLength+=len;\n      if(!points.length)points.push(u);\n      points.push(v);\n    }\n  }\n  function addBend(cx,cz,direction){\n    for(let i=0;i<P.bendSegments;i++){\n      const a=-Math.PI/2+i*Math.PI/P.bendSegments;\n      const b=-Math.PI/2+(i+1)*Math.PI/P.bendSegments;\n      const u=new THREE.Vector2(cx+direction*radius*Math.cos(a),cz+radius*Math.sin(a));\n      const v=new THREE.Vector2(cx+direction*radius*Math.cos(b),cz+radius*Math.sin(b));\n      const len=Math.PI*radius/P.bendSegments;\n      pieces.push({u,v,len,s:routeLength+len/2});routeLength+=len;points.push(v);\n    }\n  }\n  addLine(new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,startZ),new THREE.Vector2(startX,startZ),12);\n  for(let i=0;i<P.passes;i++){\n    const z=startZ+i*P.pitch,forward=i%2===0;\n    addLine(new THREE.Vector2(forward?startX:endX,z),new THREE.Vector2(forward?endX:startX,z),P.straightSegments);\n    if(i<P.passes-1)addBend(forward?endX:startX,z+radius,forward?1:-1);\n  }\n  addLine(new THREE.Vector2(startX,-startZ),new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,-startZ),12);\n  function box(w,h,d,x,y,z,material=metal){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),material);\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);modelGroup.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  box(P.length,channelBottom+P.thickness/2,P.width,0,(-P.thickness/2+channelBottom)/2,0);\n  // Subtract a polygonal ribbon from the middle layer using a Shape hole.\n  const outer=new THREE.Shape();\n  outer.moveTo(-P.length/2-.02,-P.width/2);outer.lineTo(P.length/2,-P.width/2);\n  outer.lineTo(P.length/2,P.width/2);outer.lineTo(-P.length/2-.02,P.width/2);outer.closePath();\n  const left=[],right=[];\n  points.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    const prev=points[Math.max(0,i-1)],next=points[Math.min(points.length-1,i+1)];\n    const tangent=next.clone().sub(prev).normalize();\n    const normal=new THREE.Vector2(-tangent.y,tangent.x).multiplyScalar(P.channelWidth/2);\n    left.push(p.clone().add(normal));right.push(p.clone().sub(normal));\n  });\n  const ribbon=left.concat(right.reverse()),hole=new THREE.Path();\n  ribbon.forEach((p,i)=>i?hole.lineTo(p.x,-p.y):hole.moveTo(p.x,-p.y));\n  hole.closePath();outer.holes.push(hole);\n  const coreGeo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(outer,{depth:P.channelDepth,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:12});\n  coreGeo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);coreGeo.translate(0,channelBottom,0);\n  modelGroup.add(new THREE.Mesh(coreGeo,metal));\n  const cover=box(P.length,P.wall,P.width,0,P.thickness/2-P.wall/2,0);\n  const ports=[];\n  for(const z of [startZ,-startZ]){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,P.portOuterDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const bore=new THREE.Path();bore.absarc(0,0,P.portDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(bore);\n    const geo=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:P.portLength,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n    geo.rotateY(-Math.PI/2);\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(geo,metal);port.position.set(-P.length/2,channelY,z);\n    modelGroup.add(port);ports.push(port);\n    const boreMesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.portDiameter/2,P.portDiameter/2,P.portLength,24),fluidMaterial.clone());\n    boreMesh.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;boreMesh.position.set(-P.length/2-P.portLength/2,channelY,z);\n    modelGroup.add(boreMesh);\n  }\n  const flowMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,P.channelDepth,P.channelWidth),fluidMaterial,pieces.length);\n  const dummy=new THREE.Object3D();\n  pieces.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    dummy.position.set((p.u.x+p.v.x)/2,channelY,(p.u.y+p.v.y)/2);\n    dummy.rotation.set(0,-Math.atan2(p.v.y-p.u.y,p.v.x-p.u.x),0);\n    dummy.scale.set(p.u.distanceTo(p.v)+.08,1,1);dummy.updateMatrix();\n    flowMesh.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);\n    samples.push({x:dummy.position.x,z:dummy.position.z,s:p.s});\n  });\n  flowMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;flowMesh.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(flowMesh);\n  const surfaceGeo=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(P.length,P.width,64,36);\n  surfaceGeo.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);surfaceGeo.translate(0,P.thickness/2+.04,0);\n  const positions=surfaceGeo.attributes.position;\n  surfaceGeo.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(new Float32Array(positions.count*3),3));\n  const surface=new THREE.Mesh(surfaceGeo,tempMaterial);modelGroup.add(surface);\n  const nearest=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<positions.count;i++){\n    let best=Infinity,localS=0;\n    const x=positions.getX(i),z=positions.getZ(i);\n    pieces.forEach(p=>{\n      const dx=p.v.x-p.u.x,dz=p.v.y-p.u.y;\n      const t=THREE.MathUtils.clamp(((x-p.u.x)*dx+(z-p.u.y)*dz)/(dx*dx+dz*dz),0,1);\n      const distance=Math.hypot(x-p.u.x-t*dx,z-p.u.y-t*dz);\n      if(distance<best){best=distance;localS=p.s+(t-.5)*p.len;}\n    });\n    nearest.push({s:localS,d:Math.max(0,best-P.channelWidth/2)});\n  }\n  function calculate(){\n    const c=P.fluids[P.fluid],Q=P.flowLpm/60000,A=P.channelWidth*P.channelDepth*1e-6;\n    const wet=2*(P.channelWidth+P.channelDepth)*.001,Dh=4*A/wet,L=routeLength*.001;\n    const v=Q/A,Re=c.rho*v*Dh/c.mu,Nu=Re<P.transitionRe?P.laminarNu:.023*Re**.8*c.Pr**.4;\n    const h=Nu*c.k/Dh,rise=P.heat/(c.rho*Q*c.cp),flux=P.heat/(wet*L);\n    const offset=flux/h+flux*P.wall*.001/P.alK;\n    const f=Re<P.transitionRe?64/Re:.316*Re**(-.25);\n    const vf=Q/(Math.PI*(P.portDiameter*.001)**2/4);\n    const friction=f*L/Dh*c.rho*v*v/2;\n    const bends=(P.passes-1)*P.bendK*c.rho*v*v/2,connections=P.portK*c.rho*vf*vf/2;\n    const outlet=P.inlet+rise,maxWall=outlet+offset,dp=(friction+bends+connections)/1000;\n    const labels=['Outlet temperature','Max wall temperature','Total pressure drop','Reynolds number','Convective HTC','Total flow-path length'];\n    const units=['°C','°C','kPa','','W/(m²·K)','m'];\n    const values=[outlet.toFixed(2),maxWall.toFixed(2),dp.toFixed(2),Re.toFixed(0),h.toFixed(0),L.toFixed(3)];\n    const metrics=labels.map((label,i)=>({label,value:values[i],unit:units[i],note:'Page live calculation takes precedence'}));\n    return {rise,offset,maxWall,metrics,friction,bends,connections};\n  }\n  const palette=P.temperatureColors.map(c=>new THREE.Color(c));\n  let result,temperatureMode=true,sectionMode=false;\n  function tempColor(T){\n    const t=THREE.MathUtils.clamp((T-P.inlet)/(result.maxWall-P.inlet),0,1)*4;\n    const i=Math.min(3,Math.floor(t));return palette[i].clone().lerp(palette[i+1],t-i);\n  }\n  function refresh(){\n    result=calculate();window.__metrics=result.metrics;\n    const m=result.metrics;\n    document.getElementById('temps').textContent=`Outlet ${m[0].value} °C · peak wall ${m[1].value} °C`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').textContent=`Δp ${m[2].value} kPa · Re ${m[3].value}`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').title=`Friction ${(result.friction/1000).toFixed(2)}, bends ${(result.bends/1000).toFixed(2)}, ports ${(result.connections/1000).toFixed(2)} kPa`;\n    document.getElementById('htc').textContent=`h ${m[4].value} W/(m²·K) · flow path ${m[5].value} m`;\n    document.getElementById('low').textContent=P.inlet.toFixed(1)+' °C';\n    document.getElementById('high').textContent=result.maxWall.toFixed(1)+' °C';\n    pieces.forEach((p,i)=>flowMesh.setColorAt(i,temperatureMode?tempColor(P.inlet+result.rise*p.s/routeLength):new THREE.Color(P.fluidColor)));\n    flowMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;\n    const colors=surfaceGeo.attributes.color;\n    nearest.forEach((p,i)=>{\n      const wall=P.inlet+(result.rise*p.s/routeLength+result.offset)*Math.exp(-p.d/P.fadeDistance);\n      const color=tempColor(wall);colors.setXYZ(i,color.r,color.g,color.b);\n    });\n    colors.needsUpdate=true;surface.visible=temperatureMode&&!sectionMode;cover.visible=!sectionMode;\n  }\n  document.getElementById('fluid').onchange=e=>{P.fluid=e.target.value;refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('flow').oninput=e=>{const value=Number(e.target.value);if(value>0&&value<=40){P.flowLpm=value;refresh();}};\n  document.getElementById('mode').onclick=e=>{temperatureMode=!temperatureMode;e.target.textContent=temperatureMode?'Material view':'Temperature map';refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=e=>{sectionMode=!sectionMode;e.target.textContent=sectionMode?'Full view':'Section view';refresh();};\n  const rotateButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  rotateButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');};\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: off';});\n  refresh();\n  const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  function fit(){\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    const angle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(angle)/.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);\n  }\n  fit();\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(500,20,0xdad6cf,0xe9e5df);\n  grid.position.y=bounds.min.y-2;scene.add(grid);\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();});\n  Object.assign(window,{__scene:scene,__camera:camera,__renderer:renderer,__controls:controls,__model:modelGroup});\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error) {showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n<<<METRICS>>>\n[{\"label\":\"Outlet temperature\",\"value\":\"29.28\",\"unit\":\"°C\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"},{\"label\":\"Max wall temperature\",\"value\":\"51.00\",\"unit\":\"°C\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"},{\"label\":\"Total pressure drop\",\"value\":\"47.15\",\"unit\":\"kPa\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"},{\"label\":\"Reynolds number\",\"value\":\"5240\",\"unit\":\"\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"},{\"label\":\"Convective HTC\",\"value\":\"1539\",\"unit\":\"W/(m²·K)\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"},{\"label\":\"Total flow-path length\",\"value\":\"1.874\",\"unit\":\"m\",\"note\":\"Page live calculation takes precedence\"}]\n<<<SUGGESTIONS>>>\n[\"Compare glycol and pure water across flow rates from 4 to 12 L/min.\",\"Compare this series layout with six parallel channels, including manifold losses.\",\"Add cell contact resistance and a conjugate heat-spreading estimate.\"]\n<<<END>>>", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 4774, "prompt_tokens": 3533, "total_tokens": 8307, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0, "text_tokens": null}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 3530, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": null}}, "latency_s": 193.1, "ttft_s": 7.1, "model": "gpt-6-astra", "actual_model": "gpt-6-astra-2026-09-03", "completion_id": null, "request_id": null, "source": "live", "predicted": false, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "scenario_id": "thermal_sim", "prompt": "Run a quick thermal/flow estimate for a battery cold plate: aluminium-alloy plate 320×180×12 mm with 6 serpentine channels in series (10 mm wide, 6 mm deep, 1.5 mm wall), φ12 mm inlet and outlet on the same short side. Coolant is 50% ethylene-glycol/water at 8 L/min, inlet 25 °C; the cells deliver 2 kW total (uniform) to the top surface. Build the cold-plate 3D model, show a blue→red false-colour temperature map of the coolant rise along the channels and of the top-surface wall temperature, estimate outlet temperature, maximum wall temperature, total pressure drop (friction + bends), Reynolds number and convective heat-transfer coefficient with a lumped / 1-D model, and explain how this estimate differs from CFD and where it applies.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-09-10T05:54:56+00:00", "scrubbed": {"at": "2026-09-11T01:39:03+00:00", "reason": "organization names removed fro